@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@actorId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@userId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

# Requer SYNERGIA_ENV=development|test|homologation e
# Use um access token de usuário com a permissão global access.admin.

### Criar usuario sintetico
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "display_name": "Usuario Sintetico",
  "status": "active",
  "emails": [
    {"email": "usuario@example.invalid", "is_primary": true}
  ],
  "reason": "demonstracao administrativa"
}

### Listar com filtros e paginacao
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?status=active&name=Sintetico&page=1&page_size=25
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Consultar por UUID interno
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Atualizar com versao otimista
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "version": 1,
  "display_name": "Usuario Sintetico Atualizado",
  "emails": [
    {"email": "atualizado@example.invalid", "is_primary": true}
  ],
  "reason": "demonstracao de atualizacao"
}

### Desativar sem excluir historico
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/deactivate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "version": 2,
  "reason": "demonstracao de desativacao"
}
